          "type": "quiz",
          "question": "Which notes make Cmaj7?",
          "options": [
            "C E G Bb",
            "C Eb G Bb",
            "C E G B",
            "C E G A"
          ],
          "answer": 2,
          "explanation": "Major 7 is a major triad with a major 7th on top: gaps 4 3 4. C E G, then G up 4 is B. C E G Bb is C7 (dominant); C E G A is C6."
        },
